WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:02,780
Mom

2
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:05,780
Why did you suddenly remember to call me so late?

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:06,780
Brat

4
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:08,780
If mom is fine, I can’t call you.

5
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:11,780
You don’t even know how to call mom when you’re out there.

6
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:12,780
Aren't I busy lately?

7
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:13,780
busy busy busy

8
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:14,780
When were you not busy?

9
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:15,780
Nothing happens

10
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,780
It's because your dad misses you

11
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:19,780
Mom said I haven’t seen you for a long time

12
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:20,780
I'll go back to see you in two days

13
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:21,780
Go back this time

14
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:22,780
I'll bring you good things

15
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:23,780
Don't buy useless ones

16
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:24,780
There is nothing missing at home

17
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:26,780
It'll be fine as long as you come back

18
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:27,780
I know

19
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:28,780
Assistant Ruan

20
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:29,780
I'll be busy tomorrow when I'm free

21
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,870
Accompany me to the mall and receive it

22
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:34,350
I'll pick you up at eight o'clock tomorrow morning

23
00:00:34,350 --> 00:00:35,350
come in

24
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:39,400
The door is unlocked, Mr. Li

25
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:42,430
Are you usually this casual?

26
00:00:42,430 --> 00:00:43,430
What's wrong

27
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:45,430
It’s not that I’m really a grown-up guy wearing street stalls.

28
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:46,430
Everyone has to say it, okay?
